NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the NeuralForge source code only.

NeuralForge contains no vendor code, no extracted model weights, and no
redistributed runtime, and none will be accepted into this repository. The
neural rendering runtime is proprietary software licensed to end users by its
vendor; users supply their own copy from software they already licence.

Weights converted locally for the portable backends are derived from that
licensed material and remain subject to its terms. Do not distribute them.

See runtimes/README.md.
